{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "1b9910199620bf76b188a1f5d6344b3f7245ca78125cb3cb421061e3a1fffbf5", "documents": [{"id": "offline-1b9910199620bf76b188", "filename": "24-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "1b9910199620bf76b188a1f5d6344b3f7245ca78125cb3cb421061e3a1fffbf5", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/1b9910199620bf76b188a1f5d6344b3f7245ca78125cb3cb421061e3a1fffbf5.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1b9910199620bf76b188a1f5d6344b3f7245ca78125cb3cb421061e3a1fffbf5.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}, {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-12mKDPLL8apPLWP2v5xXW7b8gzP1M6hAv-C-0", "label": "Jahshan set 24 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [268, 269, 270, 271], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "What general point does John make about physiotherapy\nA It allows patients to opt for a less invasive form of treatment.\nB It tends to be used in conjunction with other forms of treatment.\nC It places more emphasis on prevention than other forms of treatment.", "sourcePage": 268, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "John suggests that before treating a patient with scoliosis, the physiotherapist needs\nA to develop a treatment plan based on a description of the symptoms.\nB to establish whether the cause of the condition has been identified.\nC to determine which of the two main types is being presented.", "sourcePage": 268, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "John feels that once scoliosis is confirmed, the priority for the multi-disciplinary team\nshould be\nA to determine the severity of the condition.\nB to agree how exercises will complement medication.\nC to ensure that the patients’ pain is being well managed.", "sourcePage": 268, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "The second phase in John’s preferred treatment plan for scoliosis focuses on\nA using new techniques on various joints in the body.\nB regaining full movement in the affected part of the spine.\nC ensuring the patient has realistic aims regarding the likely outcome.", "sourcePage": 269, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "John believes that success in the final phase of treatment depends on\nA handing long-term responsibility over to the patient.\nB ongoing co-operation between physiotherapist and patient.\nC practical assistance supplied by practitioners in other professions.", "sourcePage": 269, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "John suggests that patients with mild to moderate scoliosis often\nA find the demands of physiotherapy too challenging.\nB express doubts about the effectiveness of physiotherapy.\nC lack the motivation to gain any benefit from physiotherapy.\nNow look at extract two.\n\nExtract 2: Questions 37 to 42\nYou hear an interview with Dr Michael Greger, an expert on vegan diet.\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 269, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "What is the biggest progress to vegan diet as per the doctor.\nA clinics operating on plant-based diet\nB surge in plant-based nutrition movement\nC Palpable changes in health sector", "sourcePage": 270, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Why does the doctor think a change is inevitable?\nA majority of the illnesses are largely preventable\nB there is a degree of control on human longevity\nC risk factors to health have been precipitating", "sourcePage": 270, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 273, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "